WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:53.346 --> 00:01:03.079
[A woman wearing a hospital gown is on all fours on a bed, then sits up.]

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:15.080
[She stands, touches the walls, sits back down.]

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:33.413
[She is smiling, laughing, rocking, and tugging at her hospital gown.]

00:01:33.413 --> 00:01:44.646
[She sits, stands, speaks, tears paper,]

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:59.446
[She rolls around on the bed.]

00:01:59.446 --> 00:02:15.579
[...]

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:38.013
[A  vial of medication is shown and a syringe prepared. The woman is injected.]

00:02:38.013 --> 00:02:44.946
[...]

00:02:44.946 --> 00:02:52.679
[...]

00:02:52.680 --> 00:03:14.113
[The woman lies in bed with eyes closed. A doctor moves her head and limbs.]

00:03:14.113 --> 00:03:22.046
[...]

00:03:22.046 --> 00:03:33.346
[The woman lies still while receiving an injection, then moves slowly afterward. ]

00:03:33.346 --> 00:04:19.079
[Her mouth opens and closes and the doctor 
moves her limbs. She appears to be convulsing.]

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:28.146
[...]

00:04:28.146 --> 00:04:47.879
[The woman previously treated is sitting on a sofa, looking around. She smiles.]

00:04:47.880 --> 00:05:07.713
[...]

00:05:07.713 --> 00:05:50.179
[A doctor injects a woman lying down in a hospital bed. She appears mostly sedated but moves her limbs now and then.]

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:56.213
[...]

00:05:56.213 --> 00:06:51.779
[The woman seems to have a mild seizure. The doctor stands over her, straightening her limbs if they flail.]

00:06:51.780 --> 00:07:14.246
[...]

00:07:14.246 --> 00:07:39.112
[A bottle of methoquinine is shown, then a table of other vials and a nurse mixing the dose.]

00:07:39.113 --> 00:08:00.000
[A bottle of metrazol is shown and the nurse continues her work, preparing a syringe.]

00:08:30.313 --> 00:08:48.946
[...]

00:08:48.946 --> 00:09:25.912
[The nurse hands the syringe to the doctor, who injects another patient.]

00:09:25.913 --> 00:09:54.846
[The patient is initially still but then begins to jerkily move her head and body.]

00:09:54.846 --> 00:10:01.479
[...]

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:40.846
[The patient lies in bed, eyes closed, with the doctor's hand on the back of her neck.]

00:10:40.846 --> 00:12:03.746
[...]

00:12:03.746 --> 00:12:25.612
[A man lies in bed, and an attendant is cleaning the area around his temples. He then places an apparatus on the man's head.]

00:12:25.613 --> 00:12:36.179
[...]

00:12:36.180 --> 00:13:23.480
[The electro-shock is administered and the man's body reacts, turning and convulsing. He goes still, breathing heavily.]

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:30.346
[...]

00:13:30.346 --> 00:14:12.112
[A woman receives electro-convulsive treatment. Her body goes rigid, then trembles and jerks and is finally still.]

00:14:12.113 --> 00:14:24.813
[...]

00:14:24.813 --> 00:14:36.179
[X-ray of patient's fractured spine, a result of the convulsions.]

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:48.280
[...]

00:14:48.280 --> 00:15:30.380
[A syringe of curare is prepared and administered to a male patient prior to electro-shock treatment.]

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:42.413
[...]

00:15:42.413 --> 00:16:40.779
[The electric current is delivered, and the patient convulses, at first markedly and then more mildly.]

